=2 Walkthrough
If you just completed the previous quest, {q:Overnight Delivery|Overnight Delivery|Overnight Delivery}, zone before continuing.
* Speak to {n:Ohbiru-Dohbiru} to receive a {@i:Rhinost. Canteen|504} {i:Rhinostery Canteen|Rhinost. Canteen|504}.
* Trade the {@i:Rhinost. Canteen|504} {i:Rhinostery Canteen|Rhinost. Canteen|504} to the **Giddeus Spring** at (K-12) or (E-12) in {z:Giddeus} to receive a {@i:Giddeus Water|4351} {i:Canteen of Giddeus water|Giddeus Water|4351}.
* Return to {n:Ohbiru-Dohbiru} and trade him the {@i:Giddeus Water|4351} {i:Canteen|Giddeus Water|4351} for your reward.

